@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline false
skinparam stereotypePosition top
title 3.6.8 Issue Invoices

actor "Cashier" as C
boundary "POS UI" as UI <<boundary>>
control "OrderController" as OC <<control>>
control "OrderService" as OS <<service>>
entity "ProductRepository" as PR <<entity>>
entity "SalesOrderRepository" as SR <<entity>>
entity "OrderItemRepository" as OIR <<entity>>
entity "CustomerRepository" as CR <<entity>>

== Issue invoice / complete sale ==
C -> UI: Checkout
activate UI
UI -> OC: POST /api/orders/checkout\n(CreateOrderRequest)
activate OC
OC -> OS: createOrder(request)
activate OS
OS -> PR: find products + validate stock
PR --> OS: Product list
OS -> OS: calc subtotal/discount/total
OS -> SR: save(SalesOrder)
SR --> OS: SalesOrder
OS -> OIR: saveAll(OrderItem)
OIR --> OS: items saved
OS -> PR: update inStock after sold
OS -> CR: update loyalty points/history
OS --> OC: CheckoutOrderResponse
deactivate OS
OC --> UI: 200 JSON invoice
deactivate OC
UI -> UI: show invoice dialog (overlay)
UI -> UI: reset POS state + reload products
UI --> C: transaction completed
deactivate UI

@enduml
